	)
	(text "These are perhaps ill advised 'hacky' ways\nof not having to make a doulbe sided board. \nPCB layout shows them as having a trace between them \non the bottom, but this will be achieved by placing \njumper across the header pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.654 114.3 0)
